{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many different combinations of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills can be used to make a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5f732c7d5271c3dbd9b32e62d670558d1d17f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />? Order does not matter in this problem.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2ea2cca82edf7e16e5fe080a9d6f6e094c7cda0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf {(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf {(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf {(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf {(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, at most three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills may be used.\n</p><p>If three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills are used, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills must total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, so one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bill may be used.\n</p><p>If two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills are used, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills must total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96ba88dea1cef8ace1112e74e5c87f616a55468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" />, which is impossible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is odd.\n</p><p>If one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bill is used, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills must total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d5892881022a75bb9b28d73782e5c4dcc76242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, so six <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills may be used.\n</p><p>If no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2668276d1c41b9274742bfcc30aef16cee0265bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills are used, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> bills must total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5f732c7d5271c3dbd9b32e62d670558d1d17f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />, which is impossible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is odd.\n</p><p>Thus there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b6465ec6d70977139a46784052f9e1db3d9b4e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" /> such combinations of bills that total to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5f732c7d5271c3dbd9b32e62d670558d1d17f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Zhsb5lv6jCI?t=701\">https://youtu.be/Zhsb5lv6jCI?t=701</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TErgwWMC3FQ\">https://youtu.be/TErgwWMC3FQ</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" 